    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_body_3">The urge to open %1$s will pass either way. Tap to ride it out with Impulsive.</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_title_4">Small moment</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_body_4">You don\'t have to act on this. Want to do something kinder than %1$s?</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_title_5">No judgment</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_body_5">Opening %1$s is just a pattern, not a failing. Let\'s take a beat.</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_title_6">Hey you</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_body_6">The pull toward %1$s is real, and so is your choice. Tap to sit with it.</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_title_7">Quick gut-check</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_body_7">Is %1$s the thing you meant to open, or the thing habit opened?</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_title_8">Worth a pause</string>
    <string name="notif_blocked_attempt_body_8">Give %1$s thirty seconds of second-thought. Future-you might thank you.</string>
